\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [testify no less to \'97 t\'e9moigner: the witness-stand register; the double negative of the reluctant concession]\cf0 \strokec2  an action of the future on the present, or of the present on the past: thus the convergent wave and the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 potentiel anticip\'e9
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [anticipated potential \'97 the physics term of art is advanced potential: the time-reversed solution, paired with the ingoing wave; anticiper: the \'b612\'9617 anticipation-chain in the physicist's mouth]\cf0 \strokec2 , which imply an inversion of time. More than the coupures or the zigzags, it is these causalities in reverse that shatter evolution. Likewise, in the domain that occupies us, 
