\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [defines itself by entries and exits \'97 the reflexive again; entr\'e9es/sorties: doorways and, in bookkeeping, the ledger's ins and outs \'97 the compte chain at the town gate]\cf0 \strokec2 , 
