\f4\i\b \strokec2 se poseraient
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [would pose themselves \'97 conditional + reflexive: problems self-arising, hypothetically]\cf0 \strokec2  for Islam, and also for Italy, Germany and Flanders from the eleventh century on: political power there does not imply the 
