\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [machinic processes \'97 process against mode: what runs, not how production is organized]\cf0 \strokec2 , and not by modes of production (which on the contrary depend on the processes). Thus primitive societies 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 se d\'e9finissent par
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [define themselves by \'97 the reflexive series: formations self-defining through their process]\cf0 \strokec2  mechanisms of 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 conjuration-anticipation
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [warding-anticipation \'97 the hyphenated pair: the \'b616 aphorism become a compound noun; conjurer, the plateau's constant]\cf0 \strokec2 ; State societies define themselves by 
