\f4\i\b \strokec2 englobement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of heterogeneous social formations \cf3 \strokec3 [englobing \'97 the \'b621 englobante: swallowing-into-a-globe as process-noun]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Or
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , precisely because these processes are variables of coexistence that 
