\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [are the object of a social topology \'97 faire l'objet de: the set idiom of scholarly treatment, the processes as what the topology studies]\cf0 \strokec2 , the diverse corresponding formations coexist. And they coexist in two fashions, in an extrinsic manner and in an intrinsic manner. 
