\f4\i\b \strokec2 sans qu'elle soit d\'e9j\'e0 l\'e0
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [without its being already there \'97 the d\'e9j\'e0 chain]\cf0 \strokec2 , forming part of their horizon. States 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 n'op\'e8rent pas de capture sans que le captur\'e9 ne coexiste, ne r\'e9siste\'85 ou ne fuie
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [operate no capture without the captured coexisting, resisting, or fleeing \'97 the triple ne-subjunctive; fuir: the flight-verb of the lignes de fuite: the captured escapes as flight, into towns, war machines]\cf0 \strokec2  under new forms, towns, machines de guerre\'85 The numerical composition of the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 machines de guerre
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [war machines \'97 plural in the French]\cf0 \strokec2  superposes itself on the primitive lineage organization, and simultaneously 
