\f4\i\b \strokec2 n'ont certes pas attendu le capitalisme pour se former
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [certainly did not wait for capitalism to form themselves \'97 ne pas attendre X pour: the idiom of the head start, doing without waiting for permission]\cf0 \strokec2 : from the Neolithic, even from the Paleolithic, one finds the traces of ecumenical organizations that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 t\'e9moignent
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of a long-distance commerce \cf3 \strokec3 [testify \'97 the witness-register (\'b616, \'b618)]\cf0 \strokec2 , and that traverse simultaneously the most diverse social formations (we have seen it for metallurgy).\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \cell \row

