\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb than its own proper one \cf3 \strokec3 [power \'97 puissance: potency, and the mathematician's power, the exponent: a process raised to another power, as a number is squared; the scare-quotes license the mathematical reading]\cf0 \strokec2 , 
