\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [as a function of which\'85 he will be able to recommence \'97 the fonction chain + recommencer: the limit as the drinker's own fiscal planning]\cf0 \strokec2  (
\f4\i\b \strokec2 compte tenu
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of a rest, of a pause\'85 ) \cf3 \strokec3 [account taken \'97 compte tenu de: the bookkeeping formula: the pause entered in the ledger]\cf0 \strokec2 . But, beyond this limit, there is again a threshold that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 le ferait changer d'agencement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 : 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 soit
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  as to the nature of the drinks, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 soit
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  as to the places and the hours where he drinks by habit; 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 soit, pire encore
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [whether\'85 or\'85 or, worse still \'97 the soit-series: three doors out of the agencement, graded downward]\cf0 \strokec2 , he 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 entrerait
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  into a suicidal agencement, or else into a medical, hospital agencement, etc. 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Il importe peu que
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the alcoholic 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 se trompe
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [it matters little that\'85 deceives himself \'97 the reflexive: self-deception licensed as irrelevant]\cf0 \strokec2 , or that he uses in a very ambiguous manner the theme \'ab je vais arr\'eater \'bb, the theme of the last. 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Ce qui compte
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [what counts \'97 compter: the counting-verb at the pivot: the compte chain adjudicating its own paragraph]\cf0 \strokec2 , is the existence of a spontaneous marginal criterion and marginalist evaluation that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 r\'e8glent
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the value of the whole series of \'ab verres \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [settle, regulate \'97 r\'e9gler: also to settle a bill: the series priced and paid]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 De m\'eame, avoir le dernier mot
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , in the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 agencement-sc\'e8ne de m\'e9nage
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [likewise, to have the last word \'97 the idiom itself become the example; sc\'e8ne de m\'e9nage: the set phrase for the marital row; m\'e9nage, the household \'97 the conjugal thread again (\'b63 meilleur et pire, \'b65 donner sa main), now at the domestic limit]\cf0 \strokec2 . Each\'85\
\'b2\'b3 Ga\'e9tan Pirou, \ul \strokec2 \'c9conomie lib\'e9rale et \'e9conomie dirig\'e9e\ulnone \strokec2 , \'c9d. Sedes, t. I, p. 117: \'ab The productivity of the marginal worker determines not only the wage of this marginal worker, but that of all the others, just as, when it was a matter of merchandise, the utility of the last bucket of water or the last sack of wheat commanded the value, not only of this bucket or this sack, but of all the other buckets or all the other sacks. \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [Pirou is French-original, translated from the supplied French]\cf0 \strokec2  (Marginalism 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 pr\'e9tend
