\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [\'ab after \'bb, \'ab new \'bb, \'ab make place \'bb \'97 the authors auditing their own idioms: faire place, the \'b65/\'b632/\'b636 chain-phrase, here named as a danger by the text itself]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 En fait, le seuil est d\'e9j\'e0 l\'e0
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [in fact, the threshold is already there \'97 the d\'e9j\'e0 chain resolving the audited \'ab after \'bb: no succession, coexistence]\cf0 \strokec2 , but outside the limit, which 
