\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [is content to put it at a distance, to hold it at a distance \'97 the \'e0 distance doubling: the \'b61 emperor's action at a distance (nouer \'e0 distance) become the limit's whole job \'97 the threshold bound afar, not abolished]\cf0 \strokec2 . The problem is 
