\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of stock \cf3 \strokec3 [actual interest \'97 actuel (\'b616): interest in act, effective now: the virtual stock made operative]\cf0 \strokec2 , a desirability of stock. The stock seems to us to have a necessary 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 corr\'e9lat
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [correlate \'97 the \'b618 logician's term (the town, correlate of the road): the stock too co-given with its condition]\cf0 \strokec2 : either the coexistence of territories exploited simultaneously, or the succession of exploitations on one single same territory. 
