\f4\i\b \strokec2 comporte
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  a stock, and that constitutes in the first case an extensive cultivation, in the other case an intensive cultivation (in conformity with Jane Jacobs's paradigm).\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \cell \lastrow\row
