\f6 \cf2 La succession y est seulement logique : la capture en elle-m\'eame surgit entre B et C, mais existe aussi bien entre A et B, entre C et A ; elle impr\'e8gne tout l'appareil, elle agit comme liaison non localisable du syst\'e8me . De m\'eame le surtravail : comment pourrait-on le localiser, puisque le travail le suppose ? Or l'Etat - l'Etat imp\'e9rial archa\'efque, en tout cas -, c'est cet appareil lui-m\'eame. On a toujours tort de r\'e9clamer pour l'Etat une explication suppl\'e9mentaire : ainsi nous repoussons l'Etat derri\'e8re l'Etat, \'e0 l'infini. Il vaut mieux le mettre o\'f9 il est, d\'e8s le d\'e9but, puisqu'il existe ponctuellement, au-del\'e0 de la limite des s\'e9ries primitives. Il suffit que ce point, de comparaison et d'appropriation, soit effectivement occup\'e9 pour que fonctionne l'appareil de capture, qui va surcoder les codes primitifs, substituer des ensembles aux s\'e9ries ou inverser le sens des signes. Occup\'e9, effectu\'e9, ce point l'est n\'e9cessairement, parce qu'il existe d\'e9j\'e0 dans l'onde convergente qui traverse les s\'e9ries primitives, et les entra\'eene vers un seuil o\'f9, franchissant leurs limites, elle change elle-m\'eame de sens. Les primitifs n'ont jamais exist\'e9 qu'en survie, d\'e9j\'e0 travaill\'e9s par l'onde reversible qui les emporte (vecteur de d\'e9 territorialisation). Ce qui d\'e9pend des circonstances ext\'e9rieures, c'est seulement le lieu o\'f9 s'effectue l'appareil - l\'e0 o\'f9 peut na\'eetre le \'ab mode de production \'bb agricole, Orient. C'est en ce sens que l'appareil est abstrait. Mais, en lui-m\'eame, il ne marque pas simplement une possibilit\'e9 abstraite de r\'e9versibilit\'e9, il marque l'existence r\'e9elle d'un point d'inversion comme ph\'e9nom\'e8ne irr\'e9ductible, autonome. D'o\'f9 le caract\'e8re tr\'e8s particulier de la violence d'Etat ; il est difficile d'assigner cette violence, puisqu'elle se pr\'e9sente toujours comme d\'e9j\'e0 faite.
\f1 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f6 \cf2 Any succession is purely logical: the capture in itself appears between B and C, but exists as well between A and B, between C and A; it impregnates the entire apparatus, it acts as a nonlocalizable liaison for the system. The same goes for surplus labor: How could one specify its location since labor presupposes it? Now the State-the archaic imperial State in any case-is this very apparatus. It is always a mistake to appeal to a supplementary explanation for the State: this pushes the State back behind the State, ad 7000 B.C.: APPARA TUS OF CAPTURE D 447 infinitum. It is better to leave it where it is from the start, for it exists punctually, beyond the limit of the primitive series. It is enough for this point of comparison and appropriation to be eff ectively occupied in order for the apparatus of capture to function, an apparatus that overcodes the primitive codes, substitutes sets for the series, or reverses the direction of the signs. This point is necessarily occupied, eff ectuated, because it already exists in the convergent wave that moves through the primitive series and draws them toward a threshold at which, after passing their limits, the wave itself changes direction. Primitive peoples have always existed only as vestiges, already plied by the reversible wave that carries them off (vector of deterritorialization). What is contingent upon external circumstances is only the place where the apparatus is eff ectuated-the place where the agricultural "mode of production" was able to arise: the Orient. It is in this sense that the apparatus is abstract. But in itself, it marks not simply an abstract possibility of reversibility but the real existence of a point of inversion as an autonomous, irreducible phenomenon.<br>Hence the very particular character of State violence: it is very difficult to pinpoint this violence because it always presents itself as preaccomplished.
\f1 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Succession there is only logical: capture in itself 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 surgit
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  between B and C \cf3 \strokec3 [looms up \'97 the surgir chain (\'b62, \'b67, \'b612, \'b622): the apparition-verb at the model's joints]\cf0 \strokec2 , but exists just as well between A and B, between C and A; it 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 impr\'e8gne
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the whole apparatus \cf3 \strokec3 [impregnates \'97 \'b634's verb: capture soaked through, not located]\cf0 \strokec2 , it acts as 
