\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of the system \cf3 \strokec3 [non-localizable liaison \'97 liaison: the bond (the lien family in its chemical-diplomatic dress) that binds without an address]\cf0 \strokec2 . Likewise surtravail: 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 comment pourrait-on le localiser, puisque le travail le suppose ?
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [how could one localize it, since labor supposes it? \'97 comment + conditional + the supposer chain: the question answers itself]\cf0 \strokec2  
