\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  for the State a supplementary explanation \cf3 \strokec3 [one is always wrong to demand \'97 r\'e9clamer: the claimant's verb: explanation as a claim filed, and denied]\cf0 \strokec2 : thus we 
