\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [punctually \'97 as a point: point-like existence in the topology, and the clock's punctuality: the State on time and at a point]\cf0 \strokec2 , beyond the limit of the primitive series. 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Il suffit que
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  this point, of comparison and of appropriation, be effectively occupied 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 pour que
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the apparatus of capture function \cf3 \strokec3 [it suffices that\'85 for \'97 the \'b614 minimal-condition formula: one occupied point, the whole machine]\cf0 \strokec2 , which will 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 surcoder
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the primitive codes, substitute 
