\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [sets for series \'97 the \'b637 cardinal/ordinal machinery deployed; invert the sense of the signs \'97 Jean Robert's \'ab inversion des signes \'bb (\'b618 fn.): the town's critical point generalized]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Occup\'e9, effectu\'e9, ce point l'est n\'e9cessairement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [occupied, effectuated \'97 this point is so necessarily: the fronted participles with resumptive le, the QED syntax-attack]\cf0 \strokec2 , because it exists 
