\f4\i\b \strokec2 franchissant leurs limites
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [crossing their limits \'97 franchir (\'b633): the free-crossing/enfranchisement root at the threshold]\cf0 \strokec2 , it changes itself 
