\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [comprises a public property, a public money, a public labor \'97 publics governing all three: the trinity formula's three columns (land, labor, money) in their imperial, wholly public state]\cf0 \strokec2 , formula perfect 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 en un coup
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , but which presupposes nothing \'ab private \'bb, which does not even suppose a 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 pr\'e9alable
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  mode of production, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 puisqu'il le fait na\'eetre
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [since it makes it be born \'97 faire na\'eetre (\'b67): the causative-of-birth: the State as the mode of production's parent, the \'b610\'9611 thesis restated]\cf0 \strokec2 . It is 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 l'acquis
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of archaeology \cf3 \strokec3 [the acquired \'97 l'acquis: what is won and settled, holdings of knowledge: archaeology's standing gains]\cf0 \strokec2 , the point of departure that the preceding analyses give us. The question is then: how will the State, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 apparu, form\'e9 d'un coup
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , \'ab 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 \'e9voluer
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb? \cf3 \strokec3 [appeared, formed at a stroke \'97 the coup chain; \'ab evolve \'bb in scare-quotes: the plateau's disowned word, quoted like contraband \'97 the entire anti-evolutionist argument compressed into two guillemets]\cf0 \strokec2  what are the factors of evolution or of mutation, and in what 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 rapports
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  are the evolved States with the archaic imperial State? The 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 raison
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of evolution is internal \cf3 \strokec3 [the reason \'97 raison: reason and ratio: evolution's ground and its rate in one word]\cf0 \strokec2 , whatever the exterior factors that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 l'appuient
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 . The archaic State does not surcode, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 sans lib\'e9rer aussi
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  a great quantity of decoded flows that will escape it \cf3 \strokec3 [without also liberating \'97 the sans\'85pas double-negative machine (\'b624): every operation with its leak built in]\cf0 \strokec2 . Let us recall that \'ab d\'e9codage \'bb does not signify the state of a flow whose code 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 serait compris
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  (deciphered, translatable, assimilable), but on the contrary, in a more radical sense, the state of a flow that is no longer 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 compris dans
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  its own code, that escapes its own code \cf3 \strokec3 [compris \'97 the pun the definition turns on: understood AND comprised/included: the decoded flow is not un-understood but un-contained; NOTE Massumi's handling \'97 see flags]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Or
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , on the one hand, flows that the primitive communities had relatively coded 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 trouvent l'occasion de fuir
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [find the occasion to flee \'97 fuir: the flight-verb of the lignes de fuite: flows seizing their chance]\cf0 \strokec2  as soon as the primitive codes 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 ne s'ajustent plus par eux-m\'eames
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  and subordinate themselves to the superior 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 instance
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [no longer adjust themselves by themselves \'97 the self-regulation reflexive doubled; instance (\'b646): the tribunal-agency]\cf0 \strokec2 \
