\f3  T\'f6kei, \'ab Les conditions de la propri\'e9t\'e9 fonci\'e8re dans la Chine de l'\'e9poque Tcheou \'bb, Acta antiqua 1958. Marx and Engels already recalled that the Roman plebs (partially constituted of public 
