\f4\i\b \strokec2 La plus-value n'est plus une plus-value de code (surcodage), mais devient une plus-value de flux
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [surplus value is no longer a surplus value of code (overcoding), but becomes a surplus value of flow \'97 devient: the becoming-verb at the chapter's hinge-thesis: the two surplus-values, code and flow, the Anti-Oedipus machinery arriving]\cf0 \strokec2 .\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \cell \row

