\f4\i\b \strokec2 conjonctions topiques et qualifi\'e9es
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [topical and qualified conjunctions \'97 the marked pair again: knotted, sited, qualified \'97 everything the coming conjugaison will not be]\cf0 \strokec2 . It is first the evolved empires, in the Orient as in the Occident, that elaborate this new 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 sph\'e8re publique du priv\'e9
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [public sphere of the private \'97 the genitive chiasm: publicity as the private's instrument, \'b659's thesis in four words]\cf0 \strokec2 , in institutions like those of the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 consilium
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  or the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 fiscus
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of the Roman empire \cf3 \strokec3 [the fiscus \'97 the emperor's basket, the imperial treasury: the fisc, the tax-chain's Roman proper name]\cf0 \strokec2  (it is in these institutions that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 l'esclave affranchi
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  takes a political power that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 double
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  that of the functionaries\'b3
\f5 \uc0\u8313 
\f3  \cf3 \strokec3 [the freed slave\'85 doubles \'97 the \'b655 personage in his second career, and doubler again: the freedman as the functionary's understudy, waiting in the wings of the fisc]\cf0 \strokec2 ). But it is also the autonomous cities, the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 f\'e9odalit\'e9s
