\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  elements and rapports 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 purement fonctionnels dont la nature n'est pas sp\'e9cifi\'e9e
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [considers directly purely functional elements and relations whose nature is not specified \'97 fonctionnel: the fonction chain at its mathematical purity: relations without qualified terms]\cf0 \strokec2 , and which 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 se r\'e9alisent imm\'e9diatement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  at once in very diverse domains, whereas the codes are relative to these domains, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 \'e9noncent
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  specific rapports between 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 \'e9l\'e9ments qualifi\'e9s
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [enounce \'97 \'e9noncer (\'b634, fn. 45): codes as enunciations, sited speech]\cf0 \strokec2 , which can be 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 ramen\'e9s
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  to a superior formal unity (surcodage) only 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 par transcendance et indirectement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [brought back \'97 ramener (\'b64): the reduction-verb; by transcendence: the immanent/transcendent pair set: overcoding needs a beyond, the axiomatic does not]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Or
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 immanent
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  axiomatic, in this sense, finds in the domains it 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 traverse
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  so many models 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 dits de r\'e9alisation
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 . One will say likewise that capital as 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 droit
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , as element \'ab qualitatively homogeneous and quantitatively commensurable \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [the Sweezy phrase (fn. 44) re-quoted: the plateau citing its own footnote]\cf0 \strokec2 , realizes itself in sectors and means of production (or that \'ab 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 capital global
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb realizes itself in \'ab 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 capital parcellis\'e9
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [global capital\'85 parceled capital \'97 parcelle: the land-parcel: capital divided like plots of ground (\'b637's portions de terre), the agrarian register persisting inside finance; global: whole, total \'97 not "unified"]\cf0 \strokec2 ). It is however not the different sectors that serve by themselves as models of realization, it is the States, of which each groups and combines several sectors, according to its resources, its population, its wealth, its 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 \'e9quipement
