\f4\i\b \strokec2 saut qualitatif
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [overflows them\'85 a qualitative leap \'97 d\'e9border again]\cf0 \strokec2 ; for example, Bradbury: television no longer even being an instrument that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 ferait
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the center of the house \cf3 \strokec3 [would make \'97 conditional: the rejected picture voiced in its mood]\cf0 \strokec2 , but constituting 
