\f4\i\b \strokec2 qui traverse ainsi une longue histoire
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [that traverses thus a long history \'97 singular verb: knot-bond-capture as one thing crossing three ages]\cf0 \strokec2 : first imperial, objective collective lien; then all the forms of subjective personal liens; finally 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 le Sujet qui se lie lui-m\'eame
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [the Subject that binds itself \'97 se lier: the lier chain's absolute terminus: after the Binder-Gods (\'b61) and the personal bonds (\'b659), the Subject as its own Dieu-lieur]\cf0 \strokec2 , and thus renews the most 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 magique
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  operation, \'ab the cosmopolitan energy that overturns every barrier and every lien 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 pour se poser elle-m\'eame comme la seule universalit\'e9, la seule barri\'e8re et le seul lien
\f5\i0\b0 \strokec2 \uc0\u8309 
\f3 \'b3 \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [in order to posit itself as the sole universality, the sole barrier and the sole bond \'97 the \'b663 terminus-phrase (le seul lien) revealed as Marx's own: the plateau's closing formula was a citation all along; translated from the supplied French pending verified English]\cf0 \strokec2 . Even assujettissement is only a 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 relais
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  for the fundamental moment of the State \cf3 \strokec3 [a relay \'97 prendre le relais (\'b65): subjection as Scaevola to capture's Cocles, the handoff-figure closing]\cf0 \strokec2 , civil capture or machinic asservissement. Assuredly the State is neither 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 le lieu de la libert\'e9
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , nor the agent of a forced servitude or a 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 capture de guerre
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [war capture \'97 the \'b62 distinction's last patrol: State capture still not war-booty]\cf0 \strokec2 . Must one then speak of a \'ab 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 servitude volontaire
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb? \cf3 \strokec3 [voluntary servitude \'97 La Bo\'e9tie's Discours named in its own words: the classic answer summoned to be declined]\cf0 \strokec2  It is like the expression \'ab capture magique \'bb: it has only the merit of underlining the apparent 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 myst\'e8re
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [the \'b66 verdict verbatim: the words describe the situation well, and explain nothing \'97 the plateau auditing its own title-phrase one last time]\cf0 \strokec2 . There is a machinic asservissement, of which 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 on dirait chaque fois qu'il se pr\'e9suppose, qu'il n'appara\'eet que comme d\'e9j\'e0 fait
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , and which is no more \'ab voluntary \'bb than it is \'ab forced \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [one would say each time that it presupposes itself, that it appears only as already done \'97 the d\'e9j\'e0 fait / se pr\'e9supposer signature (\'b63, \'b66, \'b650\'9653) at its final station, now predicated of the machine we are in]\cf0 \strokec2 .\
Proposition XIV: 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Axiomatique et situation actuelle
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 . \cf3 \strokec3 [Axiomatic and actual situation \'97 actuel: the in-act register even in the title]\cf0 \strokec2 \
Politics is certainly not an 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 apodictique
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  science. It 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 proc\'e8de par
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  experimentation, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 t\'e2tonnement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , injection, withdrawal, advances, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 reculades
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [backings-down \'97 reculade: the retreat with its shame attached, the climb-down: statecraft's inglorious verb-list]\cf0 \strokec2 . The factors of decision and prevision are limited. 
