\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of geometry \cf3 \strokec3 [theorematic \'97 the theorem/problem pair: Euclid's deductive geometry against the problem-calculus, the nomad-science distinction (the Treatise's earlier proposition) recalled]\cf0 \strokec2 . When 
