\f3  \cf3 \strokec3 [an entirely other abstract machine, working in the undecidable and in the fleeing \'97 machine abstraite (Rhizome \'b62c, \'b649); le fuyant: the fugitive substantivized \'97 flight as the medium worked in, not the leak sealed]\cf0 \strokec2 . It is the real characters of the axiomatic that 
