\f4\i\b \strokec2 rien n'est jou\'e9 d'avance
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [nothing is played in advance \'97 jouer + d'avance: the gambling idiom: the game not rigged \'97 the plateau's political wager, hope phrased as an unfixed table]\cf0 \strokec2 . One can in this regard 
