\f4\i\b baisse tendancielle du taux de profit
\f3\i0\b0  \cf3 \strokec3 [tendential fall of the rate of profit \'97 Marx's term of art, the tendenzieller Fall: the law that is only a tendency]\cf0 \strokec2 .\
