\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [it would like to make believe that it runs up against the limits of the Universe \'97 the conditional + faire croire: belief manufactured (croire \'e0, \'b614); se heurter (\'b681): the collision-verb; Univers capitalized: the cosmic alibi]\cf0 \strokec2 , at the extreme limit of resources and energies. But it 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 ne se heurte qu'\'e0 ses propres limites
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  (periodic depreciation of existing capital), and 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 ne repousse ou ne d\'e9place que ses propres limites
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [repels or displaces only its own limits \'97 repousser: the \'b616/\'b627 formula verbatim (the receding convergence-point, capitalism repelling its own limits): the plateau's oldest mechanism restated as the profit-rate chapter's content]\cf0 \strokec2  (formation of a new capital, in new industries with a high rate of profit). 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 C'est l'histoire du p\'e9trole et du nucl\'e9aire.
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [It is the history of oil and of nuclear power \'97 the book's present again: the 1970s energy crisis as the limit-displacement's live example]\cf0 \strokec2  And the two 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 \'e0 la fois
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 : it is at the same time that capitalism 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 se heurte \'e0
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  its limits and that it displaces them, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 pour les poser plus loin
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [in order to pose them farther off \'97 poser: the limit re-posited down the road: the receding horizon (\'b616, mis au dehors \'e0 mesure qu'on s'en approche) now self-administered]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 On dira que
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the totalitarian tendency, to restrict the axioms, corresponds to the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 affrontement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of the limits, while the social-democratic tendency corresponds to the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 d\'e9placement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of the limits \cf3 \strokec3 [confrontation\'85 displacement \'97 the two poles mapped onto the two relations to the limit: \'b630's limite/seuil machinery gone macroeconomic]\cf0 \strokec2 .\
