\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of the capitalist axiomatic \cf3 \strokec3 [re-handlings \'97 remanier: main, the hand: the axiomatic reworked by hand, the Manchot's register in the bureaucrat's verb]\cf0 \strokec2 , that is to say the 
