\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , which imply above all derived propositions \cf3 \strokec3 [overflow the frame of the enterprises \'97 d\'e9border + cadre: the flood-verb at the shop-gate; note the French has simply \'ab des entreprises \'bb]\cf0 \strokec2 . The struggles 
