\f4\i\b \strokec2 volontairement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  plan the liquidation of a factory in a country \cf3 \strokec3 [voluntarily, deliberately \'97 the servitude volontaire word (\'b680) on the other side of the ledger: the firm's free will]\cf0 \strokec2 ). The danger 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 d\'e8s lors
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of a worldwide workers' bureaucracy or technocracy that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 se chargeraient
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  of these problems can itself be 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 conjur\'e9
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  only 
