\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  local struggles take directly for targets the national and international axioms \cf3 \strokec3 [warded off \'97 conjurer: the plateau's oldest verb, the primitives' art (\'b612\'9616), prescribed to the movement itself: ward off your own bureaucracy as the villages warded off the State \'97 the anticipation-conjuration mechanism become political program]\cf0 \strokec2 , precisely at the point of their insertion in the 
