\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [delivered over to precarious labor \'97 livrer: handed over, the delivery-and-betrayal verb; pr\'e9caire: the word that became the concept \'97 precarity's birth-certificate in this sentence]\cf0 \strokec2  (
\f4\i\b \strokec2 sous-traitance, travail int\'e9rimaire ou noir
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [subcontracting, temp work or black work \'97 travail noir: the undeclared, off-the-books labor: the compte chain's shadow-side, work kept off the ledger]\cf0 \strokec2 ), and whose official subsistence is only 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 assur\'e9e
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  by State 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 allocations
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  and 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 salaires pr\'e9caris\'e9s
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [precarized wages \'97 the -is\'e9 process: wages MADE precarious, precarization as an operation performed]\cf0 \strokec2 . 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 Il appartient \'e0 des penseurs comme Negri
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , from the exemplary case of Italy, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 d'avoir fait la th\'e9orie de cette marge int\'e9rieure
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [to have made the theory of this interior margin \'97 la marge: the \'b630/\'b632 marginal machinery's political payoff: the marginalist's margin become the social margin, Negri as its theorist]\cf0 \strokec2 , which tends more and more to 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 fondre
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  the students with the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 emarginati
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [melt together \'97 fondre: the foundry verb; emarginati: the Italian kept \'97 autonomia's own word for the marginalized, the marge in its native tongue]
\f5 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u8310 \u8304 
\f3 . These phenomena confirm the difference between the new 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 asservissement machinique
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  and classical 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 assujettissement
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 . For assujettissement remained centered on labor, and 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 renvoyait \'e0
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  a bipolar organization, property-labor, bourgeoisie-proletariat. Whereas, in asservissement and the central dominance of constant capital, labor seems to 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 \'e9clater dans deux directions
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [burst in two directions \'97 \'e9clater: the explosion-verb: labor shattered, not divided]\cf0 \strokec2 : that of an 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 intensive surtravail qui ne passe m\'eame plus par le travail
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , and that of an 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 extensive travail devenu pr\'e9caire et flottant
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [an intensive surplus labor that no longer even passes by way of labor \'97 the \'b640 formula inverted across fifty-eight paragraphs: there, no labor without passing through surtravail; here, surtravail no longer passing through labor \'97 the chiasm closing the plateau's labor-theory; flottant: floating, the currency-float register \'97 labor floated like an exchange rate]\cf0 \strokec2 .\
