\f4\i\b \strokec2 en vertu de la loi la plus profonde du capitalisme: il ne cesse de poser et de repousser ses propres limites
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [in virtue of the deepest law of capitalism: it does not cease posing and repelling its own limits \'97 the \'b616/\'b627/\'b686 formula's final recitation: pose-and-repel as one continuous act]\cf0 \strokec2 , but it does so only by 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 suscitant lui-m\'eame
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  as many flows 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 en tous sens
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  that escape its axiomatic. It does not 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 s'effectuer
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  in the denumerable ensembles that serve it as models without constituting 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 du m\'eame coup
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  nondenumerable ensembles \cf3 \strokec3 [by the same stroke \'97 the coup chain's final occurrence: capture's oldest noun spent on capture's undoing]\cf0 \strokec2  that traverse and 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 bouleversent
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  these models. It does not operate the \'ab 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 conjugaison
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb of the decoded and deterritorialized flows without the flows going yet further, escaping the axiomatic that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 conjugue
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  them as well as the models that reterritorialize them, and tending to enter into \'ab 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 connexions
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb that 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 dessinent une nouvelle Terre
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [\'ab conjugation \'bb against \'ab connections \'bb, both scare-quoted: the \'b678 triple's two poles in final battle-array \'97 the axiomatic conjugates, the flows connect; that draw a new Earth \'97 dessiner + Terre capitalized: the terre that opened the plateau as capture's category redeemed as the drawn Earth, Anti-Oedipus's nouvelle terre]\cf0 \strokec2 , that constitute a machine de guerre whose 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 but
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  is no longer either the war of extermination or the peace of generalized terror, but the 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 mouvement r\'e9volutionnaire
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  (connexion of flows, composition of nondenumerable ensembles, 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 devenir-minoritaire de tout le monde
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \cf3 \strokec3 [the but/objet machinery (\'b693) resolved from below: the revolutionary machine takes movement itself as its aim; becoming-minoritarian of everybody/all-the-world \'97 the \'b6102 formula sealing the sentence]\cf0 \strokec2 ).\

\f5 \uc0\u8310 
\f3 \'b9 It is one of the essential theses of Tronti, who determined the new conceptions of the \'ab 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 ouvrier-masse
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  \'bb and of the rapport with work: \'ab To struggle against capital, the working class must struggle against itself 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 en tant que
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2  capital; it is the maximum stage of the contradiction, not for the workers but for the capitalists. (\'85) The plan of capital begins to 
\f4\i\b \strokec2 marcher \'e0 rebours
\f3\i0\b0 \strokec2 , no longer as social development, but as revolutionary process \'bb \cf3 \strokec3 [to walk backwards, against the grain \'97 \'e0 rebours; translated from the supplied French pending the Italian/English]\cf0 \strokec2 . Cf. \ul \strokec2 Ouvriers et capital\ulnone \strokec2 , p. 322; and what Negri has called the \ul \strokec2 Crise de l'\'c9tat-plan\ulnone \strokec2 , Feltrinelli. \cf3 \strokec3 (French 61 = Minnesota 67; OCR "Peltrinelli")\cf0 \strokec2 \
